Kind: ablation
Issue: #414
Takes out: the load of a thread's FS base when it comes onto a processor -- the base stays in the pcb, as it did, the trap still writes the register for the caller, and the next thread on that processor runs with the last caller's base
Accel: tcg,kvm
Run: --entry 14 300 -smp 4
Expect: act_test: \[52\] a thread read 0x[0-9a-f]+ through %fs where its own word is

